    "tagLine": "12 Months Complimentary Broadband included!",
    "floorPlan": "https://static.daft.ie/1/a/1a520833-e944-4266-a380-b1934ed61fd7.png",
    "location": "Set on Dublin's southern waterfront in Dublin 4, Sand House places you where the city meets the sea. Grand Canal Dock and the city's Central Business District are within easy walking distance, while the DART and city-centre connections put the rest of Dublin within easy reach.\n\nRight on your doorstep, Dublin Bay and the Irishtown Nature Reserve open onto miles of coastline — perfect for sea swimming, paddle-boarding, cycling or a morning walk along the strand. Sandymount Village, with its cafés, restaurants and green, is just moments away, and the shops, bars and culture of the city centre are only a short journey from home.\n\nThis is coastal living with the city at your fingertips — the best of both, in one of Dublin's most connected waterfront neighbourhoods."
