  "description": "2 Bedroom Apartment (72–87 sq.m)\n\nDesigned to offer greater flexibility, the two-bedroom, two-bathroom apartments provide space to share, host at home. Floor-to-ceiling windows and a spacious balcony with outdoor furniture make the most of the city, coastal and mountain views, while a contemporary two-tone kitchen with solid worktops and integrated Neff appliances anchors the open-plan living space. Includes fitted wardrobes, a separate utility room with washer/dryer and additional storage, and spacious bathrooms with terrazzo-effect feature tiling, a dual shower head with rain shower, heated chrome towel rail and large fitted mirror, all complemented by curated furnishings throughout.",
